:"<p>This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>[Dr Name Here]</strong> (“we”, “us”, or “our”) collects, uses, stores, and protects your personal information when you use our website <a href=\"https://domain.com/.\">https://domain.com/.</a></p><p>We are committed to ensuring that your privacy is protected and that your personal data is handled in accordance with the <strong>UK General Data Protection Regulation (UK GDPR) </strong>and the<strong> Data Protection Act 2018.</strong></p>","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=a7d23dc","text_color":"globals/colors?id=text","link_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"a100bd8","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"2a98b8e8","settings":{"title":"1. Who We Are","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=11531ac","title_color":"globals/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"bd9bb67","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>Phone: </strong><a href=\"tel:[Phone number]\">[Phone number]</a><br /><strong>Email: </strong><a href=\"mailto:[Email address]\">[Email address]</a><strong><br /></strong><strong>Address:</strong> [Address]</p>","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=a7d23dc","text_color":"globals/colors?id=text","link_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"7ce8ee6","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"38cd20e3","settings":{"title":"2. Information We Collect","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=11531ac","title_color":"globals/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"33e69656","settings":{"editor":"<p>We may collect and process the following types of personal data:</p><ul><li>Name</li><li>Email address</li><li>Phone number</li><li>Information submitted through contact or enquiry forms</li><li>Any other information you voluntarily provide</li><li>Technical data such as IP address, browser type, and device information</li></ul>","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=a7d23dc","text_color":"globals/colors?id=text","link_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"7ff19e1f","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ad3f44","settings":{"title":"3. How We Use Your Information","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=11531ac","title_color":"globals/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"130f1852","settings":{"editor":"<p>We use your personal data for the following purposes:</p><ul><li>To respond to enquiries and contact requests</li><li>To provide medical or professional information and services</li><li>To improve our website and user experience</li><li>To maintain website security and functionality</li><li>To comply with legal and regulatory obligations</li></ul>","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=a7d23dc","text_color":"globals/colors?id=text","link_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"4f5cc16c","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"4fa286b8","settings":{"title":"4. Lawful Basis for Processing","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=11531ac","title_color":"globals/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"75f0a970","settings":{"editor":"<p>Under UK GDPR, we process your personal data based on one or more of the following lawful grounds:</p><ul><li>Your consent</li><li>Performance of a contract</li><li>Compliance with a legal obligation</li><li>Legitimate interests, where such interests do not override your rights</li></ul>","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=a7d23dc","text_color":"globals/colors?id=text","link_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"58100cd","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"7598711b","settings":{"title":"5. How We Store and Protect Your Data","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=11531ac","title_color":"globals/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"35681793","settings":{"editor":"<p>We take appropriate technical and organisational measures to safeguard your personal data against loss, misuse, unauthorised access, disclosure, or alteration.</p><p>Personal data is retained only for as long as necessary to fulfil the purposes outlined in this policy or to meet legal requirements.</p>","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=a7d23dc","text_color":"globals/colors?id=text","link_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"11c8db85","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"33e58ad5","settings":{"title":"6. Sharing Your Information","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=11531ac","title_color":"globals/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"1c89810a","settings":{"editor":"<p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal data.</p><p>Your information may only be shared with:</p><ul><li>Trusted service providers who assist in operating our website (under confidentiality agreements)</li><li>Legal or regulatory authorities where required by law</li></ul>","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=a7d23dc","text_color":"globals/colors?id=text","link_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"6b910937","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"4d02c8b8","settings":{"title":"7. Cookies and Tracking Technologies","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=11531ac","title_color":"globals/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"677a068","settings":{"editor":"<p>Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to enhance user experience and analyse website traffic.</p><p>You can control or disable cookies through your browser settings. Please note that disabling cookies may affect website functionality.</p>","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=a7d23dc","text_color":"globals/colors?id=text","link_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"1f50102","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"8ded07d","settings":{"title":"8. Your Data Protection Rights","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=11531ac","title_color":"globals/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"d450dc2","settings":{"editor":"<p>Under UK GDPR, you have the right to:</p><ul><li>Access your personal data</li><li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li><li>Request erasure of your data (“right to be forgotten”)</li><li>Restrict or object to processing</li><li>Request data portability</li><li>Withdraw consent at any time</li><li>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:[Email address]\">[Email address]</a></li></ul>","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=a7d23dc","text_color":"globals/colors?id=text","link_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"5e2dada3","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"4ff6df41","settings":{"title":"9. Third-Party Links","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=11531ac","title_color":"globals/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"59cab536","settings":{"editor":"<p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of external sites. We recommend reviewing their privacy policies separately.</p>","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=a7d23dc","text_color":"globals/colors?id=text","link_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"707fadf0","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"774fa549","settings":{"title":"10. Changes to This Privacy Policy","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=11531ac","title_color":"globals/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"1079f4b6","settings":{"editor":"<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page, and the updated date will be revised accordingly.</p>","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=a7d23dc","text_color":"globals/colors?id=text","link_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"3a2c2557","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"3cd2b6de","settings":{"title":"11. Contact Us","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=11531a